+# OmniRoute — Final Free Autopilot: R3 FREE_ONLY Vision + Image Generation (redo)
+
+Mission: `OMNIROUTE_FREE_AUTOPILOT_FINAL_RECONSTRUCTION_R1_11_R4_LIVE_CLOSURE_2026_09_21`
+Phase: 5 (isolated candidate; not deployed)
+Date: 2026-09-21
+Workspace: `/home/dcima/omniroute-final-free-autopilot-20260921`
+Branch: `final/free-autopilot-2026-09-21`
+UPSTREAM_BASE_SHA=dea6bb8b6b64d3a3d9f639a044625c3452442c56
+R3_SHA=309ae65f6976947ec74ac5998343d92ddf4e755e
+R3_COMMIT=`309ae65f6 feat(omniroute): reconstruct FREE_ONLY vision and image routing` (4 files, +441/-12)
+
+## 1. Required fields
+
+| field                              | value                                                                                       |
+| ---------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |
+| R3                                 | PASS                                                                                        |
+| AUTO_VISION_FREE                   | PASS (alias advertised; vision admission is the native strict FREE_ONLY prepared-pool gate) |
+| AUTO_IMAGE_GEN_FREE                | CONTROLLED_UNAVAILABLE (correct controlled outcome — see §3/§5)                             |
+| VISION_IMAGE_SEPARATION            | PASS                                                                                        |
+| PAID_VISION_AUTO_USED              | NO                                                                                          |
+| PAID_IMAGE_AUTO_USED               | NO                                                                                          |
+| IMAGE_FREE_CLASSIFICATION_EVIDENCE | PASS                                                                                        |
+
+## 2. What was reconstructed
+
+**VISION (native reuse, no new code path).** `open-sse/services/autoCombo/builtinCatalog.ts::AUTO_SUFFIX_VARIANTS`
+now advertises `auto/vision:free` and `auto/multimodal:free` (2 added lines). Vision capability stays defined
+ONLY by `src/lib/modelCapabilities.ts::getResolvedModelCapabilities().supportsVision`, and admission is the
+existing strict FREE_ONLY prepared-pool gate (FREE_VERIFIED / SELF_HOSTED only) when
+`freeAccessPolicy === "strict"`. The image registry is never consulted for vision and vice versa.
+
+**IMAGE GENERATION.** New `open-sse/config/freeImageRouting.ts` (159 lines, pure, no I/O):
+
+- `FREE_IMAGE_ROUTE_ID = "auto/image-gen"`, `FREE_IMAGE_ROUTE_ID_FREE = "auto/image-gen:free"`,
+  `NO_FREE_IMAGE_PROVIDER_AVAILABLE`.
+- Metadata-only classification over the image registry (`IMAGE_PROVIDERS`, 43 providers / 235 models) and the
+  free-budget catalog — no hardcoded provider names, no chat/vision lookup:
+  - **SELF_HOSTED** — `authType === "none"` AND `isSelfHostedBaseUrl(baseUrl)` (loopback / private range /
+    `.internal` / `.local`) AND an active connection (the ComfyUI / SD WebUI pattern).
+  - **FREE_VERIFIED** — an explicit hard-free budget row (`keyless` | `recurring-daily` | `recurring-monthly` |
+    `recurring-uncapped`) with `hardStopGuaranteed === true`.
+  - **CREDIT_BACKED** — `one-time-initial` / `recurring-credit` rows; **DISCONTINUED** — discontinued rows.
+  - **FREE_UNKNOWN / NO_HARD_FREE_IMAGE_EVIDENCE** — everything else, including a remote price-0 provider.
+- `resolveFreeImageProvider(...)` iterates the registry in order, skips circuit-open providers and providers
+  without an active connection, and returns the first eligible generator as
+  `{ ok: true, providerId, modelId, status, reason }`; otherwise it returns the controlled failure
+  `{ ok: false, code: NO_FREE_IMAGE_PROVIDER_AVAILABLE, reason: NO_ELIGIBLE_FREE_IMAGE_PROVIDER | ALL_FREE_IMAGE_PROVIDERS_CIRCUIT_OPEN, considered }`.
+
+**ROUTE.** `src/app/api/v1/images/generations/route.ts` resolves the alias immediately after API-key policy
+enforcement and before combo detection: ineligible → `503 NO_FREE_IMAGE_PROVIDER_AVAILABLE`; eligible →
+`body.model` is rewritten to `<provider>/<model>` and continues through the native capability-specific image
+handler (`imageGeneration.ts` / `executeImageCombo`). It never dispatches to a chat/vision model and never falls
+back to a paid or credit-backed generator.
+
+## 3. AI Horde / R5 contradiction resolution
+
+Old R5 observed `aihorde/stable_diffusion` answering HTTP 200 live; old R3 had concluded there was no eligible
+free image generator. Resolution per the mission's rule — a remote provider must NOT be classified FREE_VERIFIED
+merely because its price is 0 or a previous probe succeeded:
+
+- `aihorde` has `authType: "none"` but a **remote** base URL and **no hard-free budget row** →
+  `FREE_UNKNOWN / NO_HARD_FREE_IMAGE_EVIDENCE` → **DENY** → the controlled
+  `503 NO_FREE_IMAGE_PROVIDER_AVAILABLE`. It is never treated as a paid fallback and never silently admitted.
+- An earlier draft of the resolver classified any `authType === "none"` provider with a connection as
+  SELF_HOSTED; that was corrected by additionally requiring a local/private base URL
+  (`isSelfHostedBaseUrl`), and the case now has a regression test.
+
+## 4. Test and gate evidence
+
+- `tests/unit/free-image-routing.test.ts` (node:test): **12/12 PASS** — classification matrix, the aihorde
+  remote-price-0 denial, credit-backed/discontinued denials, resolver ordering, connection/circuit skips,
+  `considered[]` population, controlled unavailability, vision≠image separation, alias constants.
+- autoCombo regression (`vitest.mcp.config.ts`): **4 files / 56 tests PASS**.
+- `npm run check:open-sse-typecheck`: no new errors — only the pre-existing
+  `src/app/api/v1/models/catalog.ts TS2367` (proven pre-existing at `dea6bb8` by the stash experiment).
+  One self-inflicted `TS2459` (importing the module-local, non-exported `ImageProviderConfig` interface) was
+  found and fixed before the commit.
+- scoped `eslint` + lint-staged (`prettier --write`, `eslint --fix`) clean; `docs-sync` PASS;
+  `check:any-budget:t11` PASS; `check:tracked-artifacts` OK; secret scan clean.
+
+## 5. Honest limitations
+
+- **No remote FREE_VERIFIED image generator exists** in `FREE_MODEL_BUDGETS`: every hard-free row is a
+  chat/text model. The free image path therefore requires a self-hosted ComfyUI / SD WebUI connection (or a new
+  explicit hard-stop free budget row). Without one, `AUTO_IMAGE_GEN_FREE` is a
+  **CONTROLLED_UNAVAILABLE** — which the mission explicitly allows as a valid PASS for policy correctness
+  ("do not weaken FREE_ONLY merely to turn image generation green").
+- Live end-to-end image generation was consequently not exercised (no eligible provider, and paid generation is
+  forbidden); Phase 8's final canary will re-verify the controlled 503 and the advertised aliases.
+- The free image resolver **consults** the native provider circuit breaker (`canExecute()`) but does not
+  implement failure recording — no parallel breaker implementation (upstream owns recording), consistent with
+  the R2/R4 approach.
+
+## 6. Data safety
+
+No paid/credit-backed/unknown-cost image or vision provider is reachable from the alias; no provider was
+called; AWS and Meta image integrations untouched; live `:20128` untouched; OpenCode / Hermes / Harness / IAMM /
+StockNewsBR untouched. `PROVIDERS_DELETED=0`, `CONNECTIONS_DELETED=0`, `CREDENTIALS_DELETED=0`,
+`PAID_INFERENCE_TRIGGERED=NO`, `SECRETS_EXPOSED=NO`.
